      "Hardening checklist:\n[ ] Default password changed\n[ ] Firmware version and patch log documented\n[ ] Cameras on a separate VLAN (e.g., VLAN 50)\n[ ] UPnP, Telnet, FTP disabled\n[ ] Management interface accessible only via VPN"
